"Its modifications are Living Artifact, Soul Forged and Blade World."
"Its item core, eaten by the blight for centuries, heals faster when bathed in compatible energy."
"Resting it on a leyline of pure mana completes its restoration."
"Pure mana poured into it burns as heatless silver flame that severs force constructs."
"Its pommel is reforged from glowing ore from the mine below Blackmist Bog."
"It can in theory conduct any frequency of mana."
"It links with a crystal assistant construct to see, hear and speak."
"It is a prison for energetic beings as much as a weapon."
